Follow root `AGENTS.md`. Summary:

- Node 20+ ESM, zero runtime deps by default
- Domain logic in `src/{search,registry,use,inspector,optimize,mcp-server}.js`; keep CLI/Web thin
- Catalog edits must keep Capability↔Provider refs bidirectional; validate against `data/catalog.schema.json`
- Prefer CLI `--json` and `CAP_HOME` temp dirs when testing
- Never expand default MCP tools beyond search/acquire/use without opt-in
- Run `npm run check` before finishing
